  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "This spacious home provides a lifestyle and location perfect for families seeking space, convenience and a quality address just moments from the golden sands of Kohi beach.\r\n\r\nThis beautiful residence spans approximately 240sqm, providing plenty of room for growing families to live, relax and entertain.  Start your day with coffee on the generous loggia, taking in the elevated view towards the harbour. The lower level features a practical and welcoming layout with two spacious living areas centred around the kitchen, creating the ideal hub for everyday life. A separate laundry and guest powder room add convenience. A seamless flow to the private rear garden and entertaining area, provides a private space for BBQ’s, spending time outdoors and is secure for children and pets.  This sun-filled space is sure to become a favourite spot.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the thoughtfully arranged accommodation consists of four bedrooms, including a master suite complete with walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and balcony.  A well-appointed family bathroom services the remaining bedrooms, offering flexibility and comfort for the whole household.  Practicality is also well catered for, with secure internal-access double garaging, additional off-street parking and abundant storage throughout.\r\n\r\nPositioned within sought-after school zones including Kohimarama School, Selwyn College and St Ignatius Catholic School, this address offers enduring appeal for families.  While nearby Madills Farm provides outstanding recreational facilities for families and active lifestyles along with local tennis and bowls clubs.  Stroll just 350 metres to Kohimarama beach for a morning swim or coffee at the popular Kohi Beach Eatery & Store. It’s a quick drive to vibrant Mission Bay, St Heliers village or Eastridge Shopping Centre for dining, entertainment and local shopping. Don't miss your chance to experience all that this exceptional Kohimarama property has to offer.\r\n\r\nTo be sold by negotiation.",
